161|### SpotLight Shadows
162|
163|```javascript
164|spotLight.castShadow = true;
165|spotLight.shadow.mapSize.width = 1024;
166|spotLight.shadow.mapSize.height = 1024;
167|
168|// Shadow camera (perspective)
169|spotLight.shadow.camera.near = 0.5;
170|spotLight.shadow.camera.far = 50;
171|spotLight.shadow.camera.fov = 30;
172|
173|spotLight.shadow.bias = -0.0001;
174|
175|// Focus (affects shadow projection)
176|spotLight.shadow.focus = 1;
177|```
